 ('LOCAL_EXCEPTIONAL_BOND','LOCAL','EACH_LOCAL_ENTITY','REUSED_LOCAL_FINANCE_LAW','5 exceptions /33-5-2 etc; separate annual statutory provisions','exception-specific; ordinary G not automatically covered','UNKNOWN_EXCEPTION_APPLICABILITY','UNKNOWN_EXCEPTION_APPLICABILITY','Applicable special provision plus plan and entity budget','FY2030 N3 exception amount unknown','repayment and individual statutory terms','No general national entitlement','unknown_or_prohibited','unknown'),
